B.Lg=new A.ac(B.c9,["Mobile App Development","We engineer high-performance, cross-platform applications using Flutter and React Native. Our apps feature native-level performance, smooth 60fps+ complex animations, deep offline-first synchronization, secure biometric authentication, and scalable real-time WebSocket integrations. Designed for millions of concurrent users.","\ud83d\udcf1"],t.l)
B.Lc=new A.ac(B.c9,["Web Development","Full-stack web applications crafted with Next.js, React, and Laravel. We build SEO-optimized, highly accessible, and lightning-fast SSR platforms. Our architecture supports microservices, complex state management, secure payment gateways, and massive data grids for enterprise resource planning (ERP).","\ud83c\udf10"],t.l)
B.Lk=new A.ac(B.c9,["UI/UX Design","We don't just build screens; we craft entire Figma-first design systems. From user psychology research, wireframing, to pixel-perfect high-fidelity prototypes. We focus on modern glassmorphism, neo-brutalism, dark mode optimization, and micro-interactions that dramatically boost user retention and conversion rates.","\ud83c\udfa8"],t.l)
B.Lb=new A.ac(B.c9,["Cloud & DevOps","Bulletproof infrastructure built on AWS, Azure, and GCP. We implement complex Kubernetes orchestration, Docker containerization, strict zero-trust security policies, automated CI/CD pipelines via GitHub Actions, and auto-scaling serverless architectures guaranteeing 99.99% uptime for mission-critical systems.","\u2601\ufe0f"],t.l)
B.Li=new A.ac(B.c9,["AI & Automation","Stay ahead of the curve by embedding intelligent AI capabilities into your product. We integrate LLMs (OpenAI, Anthropic), custom computer vision models, predictive analytics, and natural language processing pipelines to automate operations and provide intelligent user experiences.","\ud83e\udd16"],t.l)
B.Ld=new A.ac(B.c9,["IT Consultancy","Strategic technology advisory tailored to your business goals. We conduct comprehensive architecture audits, scalable code reviews, digital transformation roadmaps, and provide fractional CTO services to ensure your tech stack is future-proof and aligned with your long-term vision.","\ud83e\udde0"],t.l)
