B.L7=new A.ac(B.ia,["02","UI/UX Design & Prototyping","Our design team creates interactive Figma prototypes. We focus on neo-brutalism, glassmorphism, or clean corporate aesthetics depending on your brand identity, ensuring usability testing before a single line of code is written."],t.l)
B.L9=new A.ac(B.ia,["03","Agile Development","We build in 2-week sprints using scalable technologies like Flutter, Next.js, and Node.js. You get continuous delivery and full access to staging environments to see your product come to life in real-time."],t.l)
