B.Mg=new A.ac(B.ic,["Uncompromising Quality","We believe that code is poetry. We adhere strictly to SOLID principles, rigorous automated testing, and extensive code reviews. Our commitment to quality means fewer bugs, better performance, and scalable infrastructure from day one.",B.Gy,B.C],t.EU)
B.Gh=new A.c4(62625,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.Mi=new A.ac(B.ic,["Radical Transparency","No hidden fees. No black-box development. You get full access to our Jira boards, weekly sprint demos, and direct lines of communication to the developers building your product. We build trust by keeping you in the loop.",B.Gh,B.a2],t.EU)
B.Ge=new A.c4(58236,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.Mf=new A.ac(B.ic,["Innovation-Driven","Technology moves fast, and so do we. We continuously experiment with the latest frameworks, AI tools, and architectural patterns to ensure your software is future-proof and competitive in a rapidly evolving digital landscape.",B.Ge,B.u],t.EU)
